Package: aplsr
Title: Shared R Helpers for the AP-LS Website
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("American Psychology-Law Society", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("AP-LS", "Website Editor", email = "office@ap-ls.org", role = "cre",
           comment = "Update to the current maintainer"))
Description: Reusable helper functions used to build the American
    Psychology-Law Society (AP-LS) Quarto website, including award
    "past recipients" tables, small HTML/UI components, and utilities.
    Extracted from the site's assets/apls_functions.R so pages can call
    library(aplsr) instead of source()-ing a script.
